{"id":"c42b7f1faaf95a1c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-finite-sequence-proof.md","title":"Finite formula-sequence proofs","display":"df-finite-sequence-proof — Finite formula-sequence proofs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-finite-sequence-proof","aliases":["72-df-finite-sequence-proof"],"display":"df-finite-sequence-proof — Finite formula-sequence proofs","depends_on":["[[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files","source_kind":"local-reconstruction","verification_status":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-finite-sequence-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-finite-sequence-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-sequence-proof — Finite formula-sequence proofs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d26f8820bf776b8c\" href=\"?note=d26f8820bf776b8c\" title=\"72-df-syntactic-proof-system\">72-df-syntactic-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-reconstruction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle\">\\(P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U\">\\(\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d26f8820bf776b8c\" href=\"?note=d26f8820bf776b8c\" title=\"72-df-syntactic-proof-system\">72-df-syntactic-proof-system</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq X\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in X\">\\(\\tau\\in X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；序列从0编号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(U)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(U)\\)</span>。以下五元谓词保留原调用的参数次序：证明、假设、结论、演算、语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_U^{=}A\">\\(T\\vdash_U^{=}A\\)</span> 专指所显示的有相等公理经典演算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in X\">\\(A\\in X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是上游允许的语言或签名。泛型证明谓词以所给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为参数，最后一式则重新以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U\">\\(\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U\\)</span> 的分量实例化该谓词，不沿用其他演算的公理或规则分量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\tau,P,U):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U)\\land\\pi\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\\land0&lt;|\\pi|\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\ [\\pi_i\\in\\mathcal A\\cup\\Gamma\\lor\\exists\\vec B\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\langle\\vec B,\\pi_i\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi\\restriction i))],\\\\\nT\\vdash_U^{=}A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,A,\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U,U).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\tau,P,U):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U)\\land\\pi\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\\land0&lt;|\\pi|\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\ [\\pi_i\\in\\mathcal A\\cup\\Gamma\\lor\\exists\\vec B\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\langle\\vec B,\\pi_i\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi\\restriction i))],\\\\\nT\\vdash_U^{=}A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,A,\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U,U).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这补齐证明复杂度文件的悬空五元证明谓词。前提只能来自此前证明行，允许复用已有行，零前提规则也由空前提序列覆盖。空证明没有末行，因此显式排除。句子假设保证所给概括规则不违反未解除自由假设限制；本节点不把这种序列证明与带解除标注的自然演绎树等同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-syntactic-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d26f8820bf776b8c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-syntactic-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d26f8820bf776b8c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U)$、$P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle$ 与 $\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U$ 取 [[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]]。$\\Gamma\\subseteq X$，$\\tau\\in X$，$\\pi\\in X^{<\\omega}$；序列从0编号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U)","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in X^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(U)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_U^{=}A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\tau,P,U):\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U)\\land\\pi\\in X^{<\\omega}\\land0<|\\pi|\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=\\tau\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<|\\pi|\\ [\\pi_i\\in\\mathcal A\\cup\\Gamma\\lor\\exists\\vec B\\in X^{<\\omega}\\ (\\langle\\vec B,\\pi_i\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi\\restriction i))],\\\\\nT\\vdash_U^{=}A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in X^{<\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,A,\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U,U).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2240,"backlinks":[{"id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}$、项解释及满足关系取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]，并限制到基本语法。$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(L)$，$T\\vdash_L\\varphi$ 的证明系统明确取 [[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]] 的含相等公理的有限Hilbert系统；当 $L$ 已指定时省略下标。"},{"id":"ca39c110894da886","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$；实际证明接口是 $\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\tau,P,\\Sigma)$，取 [[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]]。$\\pi$ 为有限公式序列，$\\Gamma=\\varnothing$。"}],"outgoing":["d26f8820bf776b8c"]}